"><li>Wat Yan Yao (Wat Nikorn Wararam) <span class="fact-status unknown">Not verified</span> <span class="source-offline">Read source ↗ <small>แหล่งเดิมออฟไลน์ · ตรวจเมื่อ 8 ก.ย. 2569</small></span></li><li>Takua Pa old town / Talat Yai community <span class="fact-status unknown">Not verified</span> <a href="https://wikicommunity.sac.or.th/community/1527" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read source ↗</a></li><li>Takua Pa bus terminal <span class="fact-status unknown">Not verified</span> <a href="https://mapcarta.com/W816145865" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read source ↗</a></li><li><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a></li><li><a href="/en/places/food-center/">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</a></li></ul></section><aside class="nearby-note"><span class="chapter">Stop nearby</span><p>If you want to sit and rest after walking through the market, the old market area is not far away. An old wooden house on Thanon Rat Bamrung is open as a café.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://siwaracafe.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">A place to sit near the market ↗</a></aside><section class="research-section" id="faq"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>Opening hours</summary><p>Not verified · Saturdays, 15:00 to 20:00</p></details><details><summary>Admission fee</summary><p>Not verified · No admission fee</p></details><details><summary>Getting there from Takua Pa Town</summary><p>Travel to the riverside area or Sri Takuapa Road near Wat Yan Yao. Sources suggest using local hired vehicles or motorcycle taxis from the Takua Pa bus terminal.</p></details><details><summary>What is the history of this place?</summary><p>The market is named 'Takua Pa Riverside Market, Ruam Jai Pracharath' in the Must-See Pracharath Market project and is located on the canal-side road next to Wat Yan Yao.</p></details><details><summary>What are the highlights to see?</summary><p>Stalls sell local sweets, regional food, OTOP products, and goods from Takua Pa. The market sits beside the canal·Takua Pa River, making it suitable for riverside views and photography. User reviews say students sometimes perform live music.</p></details></section><section class="research-section" id="sources"><h2>Data Sources</h2><div class="source-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Date accessed</th><th>Link</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">กรมการค้าภายใน กระทรวงพาณิชย์ (Department of Internal Trade, Ministry of Commerce)</th><td>Official agency</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><span class="source-offline">Open source ↗ <small>แหล่งเดิมออฟไลน์ · ตรวจเมื่อ 8 ก.ย. 2569</small></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mapcarta (OpenStreetMap data)</th><td>Other resources</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://mapcarta.com/W816145865" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Thai-tour</th><td>Blog</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://www.thai-tour.com/place/phangnga/takuapa/4206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gplace</th><td>Blog</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://www.gplace.com/960259" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">ศูนย์มานุษยวิทยาสิรินธร (Princess Maha Chakri Sirindhorn Anthropology Centre): Talat Yai Community</th><td>Other resources</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://wikicommunity.sac.or.th/community/1527" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">สำนักงานนโยบายและแผนทรัพยากรธรรมชาติและสิ่งแวดล้อม (Office of Natural Resources and Environmental Policy and Planning)</th><td>Official agency</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://culturalenvi.onep.go.th/index.php/site/detail/4431" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wanderlog</th><td>Other resources</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://wanderlog.com/place/details/11412806/takuapa-river-market" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">สำนักงานนโยบายและแผนทรัพยากรธรรมชาติและสิ่งแวดล้อม (Office of Natural Resources and Environmental Policy and Planning)</th><td>Official agency</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://culturalenvi.onep.go.th/site/detail/4428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">เทศบาลเมืองตะกั่วป่า (Takua Pa Town Municipality)</th><td>Official agency</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/files/com_strategy/2022-12_231dcd9d5169573.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">ปฏิทินวัฒนธรรม กระทรวงวัฒนธรรม (Cultural Calendar, Ministry of Culture)</th><td>Official agency</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://calendar.m-culture.go.th/events/103651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Muang Boran Journal</th><td>Blog</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://www.muangboranjournal.com/post/Takuapa_Naver_Ending_Stories" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ministry of Commerce: Must-See Markets in Southern Thailand</th><td>Official agency</td><td>2026-09-07</td><td><a href="https://einspection.moc.go.th/th/file/get/file/20210720dcb8f52155b576a7ca523b2a2247e871134559.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source ↗</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><details class="unknowns"><summary>Missing data</summary><ul><li>Coordinates with a specific riverside market sign were not found, so market or nearby coordinates from OpenStreetMap via Mapcarta are used.</li><li>Phone number, Facebook page, website, or official LINE of the market not found.</li><li>Evidence confirming the founding year, creator, or historical site registration of the market not found.</li><li>Verified data on parking, restrooms, access for the elderly or wheelchairs, and dress code not found.</li><li>Festivals specific to the market not verified.</li><li>Official image links with specified usage rights are not verified.</li><li>Evidence specifying the first opening year, founder, responsible person, or owner agency of the market not found.</li><li>Evidence of the market being abandoned, restored, or changing hands during any period not found.</li><li>Evidence verifying direct impact from the 2004 tsunami on the market area not found.</li><li>Evidence of the riverside market being registered as a historical site not found; registrations found belong to other elements in the old town.</li><li>Latest market opening announcement for 2026 from direct caretakers not found, so current opening days and times cannot be verified yet.</li><li>News from the past 5 years specifying direct market restoration or development projects with clear publication dates not found.</li><li>Old photos identified directly as the riverside market area not found.</li><li>All photos are links from online travel sources with unknown rights, requiring permission before use.</li></ul></details></section></div></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><a href="/en/" class="footer-name">Takua Pa <em>101</em></a><p>One city<br>Stories to get to know</p><a class="round-link" href="#main" aria-label="กลับขึ้นด้านบน">↑</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><a href="https://siwaracafe.com/">Created by Baan Siwara, Takua Pa</a><span>Old Town Guide · Phang Nga Province</span><a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/pdf/travel-preview.pdf">Original Brochure ↗</a></div></footer><nav class="tabbar" aria-label="เมนูด่วน"><a href="/en/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>Home</a><a href="/en/map/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>Map</a><a href="/en/eat/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◉</span>Eat</a><a href="/en/trip/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◫</span>Trip<span class="qs-badge" data-trip-count hidden>0</span></a></nav></body></html>
